{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103070","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910307001:1":{"text":"マザーコーラルが砕けている。これでは内部に蓄えたエネルギーを保持できん……","source_cn":"母瑚本体破碎，无法承受其中蕴含的能量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0AEA60B3CDCFDCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910307002:1":{"text":"このままエネルギーがすべて流出すれば、マザーコーラルは……完全に枯れてしまうだろう。","source_cn":"一旦能量彻底逸散，母瑚……会彻底枯死。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18DD208578DDC052","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910307003:1":{"text":"そんな……どうして……","source_cn":"怎么会这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86D0C7F0061A56DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910307004:1":{"text":"悲観的なことばっか言うなよ！子どもたちが泣きそうになってるだろうが！","source_cn":"我说，别这么悲观行不行？瞧瞧，都快把小孩吓哭了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x054894EFB5328890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910307005:1":{"text":"さっき見に行ってきたけど、エネルギーはまだ街の外へ完全には流れ出ていない。","source_cn":"我跟着游出去看了，能量还没有完全逸散出城。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A679D3A8AC7704","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti